𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Sequence Generation
𒑰 Difficulty: Advanced
𒑰 Concept: Working Sequences & Allocation
𒑰 Mode: Mixed (Cuneiform syntax with Latin identifiers)
𒑰
𒑰 Purpose:
𒑰   Demonstrates working sequence tablet allocation, appending entries,
𒑰   and querying length, first, and last values.
𒑰
𒑰 Expected Output:
𒑰   6
𒑰   1
𒑰   8

𒂊𒁹

    working fib of length 0

    fib 1 𒈭
    fib 1 𒈭
    fib 2 𒈭
    fib 3 𒈭
    fib 5 𒈭
    fib 8 𒈭

    n : fib 𒁍
    first_val : fib first
    last_val : fib last

𒅗𒁹

    n
    first_val
    last_val
